30	 * `.max()`, on purpose: the cap is never enforced on the model — CLAUDE.md's
31	 * `forStructuredOutput` strips `maxLength` because the API 400s on it — so a
32	 * hard bound here existed only as a post-hoc throw that failed the ENTIRE
33	 * generation and surfaced as "Couldn't reach the stylist". Repair, don't reject.
34	 */
